error[E0172]: 'jsonSchema' cannot describe 'Plain': it does not carry '@json'
  --> check_json_schema_type.bit:19:22
   |
19 |   let a = jsonSchema<Plain>()
   |                      ^^^^^ mark 'Plain' with '@json' — 'jsonSchema<T>' is specialised from the same field list '@json' serializes, and never describes a type that did not opt in
error[E0172]: 'jsonSchema' cannot describe 'Colour': it is not a class
  --> check_json_schema_type.bit:20:22
   |
20 |   let b = jsonSchema<Colour>()
   |                      ^^^^^^ 'jsonSchema<T>' describes only a class carrying '@json', declared here or imported from another module by name
error[E0172]: 'jsonSchema' cannot describe 'i64': it is not a class
  --> check_json_schema_type.bit:21:22
   |
21 |   let c = jsonSchema<i64>()
   |                      ^^^ 'jsonSchema<T>' describes only a class carrying '@json', declared here or imported from another module by name
error[E0172]: 'jsonSchema' needs exactly one explicit type argument
  --> check_json_schema_type.bit:22:11
   |
22 |   let d = jsonSchema()
   |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^ write 'jsonSchema<T>()' naming the '@json' class to describe — 'T' appears only in the result, so nothing infers it from the argument
